00:01:10.280 --> 00:01:13.752
I thought I had everything
planned out, but when it hit me

00:01:13.752 --> 00:01:17.000
the only thing I could
do is get ye, yeah out.

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:20.040
And it just happy to
make everything formal.

00:01:20.040 --> 00:01:22.195
We, I always consider her my

00:01:22.195 --> 00:01:24.613
my daughter from day one.

00:01:26.030 --> 00:01:28.001
Just pure happiness.

00:01:28.001 --> 00:01:30.680
- Aw. So Ariana,

00:01:30.680 --> 00:01:34.730
you were specific, you said 2,555 days.

00:01:34.730 --> 00:01:37.597
