00:01:56.170 --> 00:01:58.540
I'm so glad that doesn't
happen for everyone.

00:01:58.540 --> 00:02:00.380
So it's such a beautiful
thing that this worked out.

00:02:00.380 --> 00:02:02.100
I'm so happy for you, Ariana.

00:02:02.100 --> 00:02:04.210
I'm so happy for you, Tia too
and to you as well, Frank.

00:02:04.210 --> 00:02:06.150
Thank y'all so much
for sharing this story.

00:02:06.150 --> 00:02:08.283
